==Description==
'''Umbra Laugh''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]]. It was obtained at Level 13 in the premium track, which costed {{CandyCorns|380 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|56}} ({{Robux|42}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock. It had a total cost of {{CandyCorns|2,460 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|772}} ({{Robux|586}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases [[The Umbra]] laughing, along with red text saying "''HA HA HA!''". Using this sticker creates a laughing sound effect from [[The Umbra]].

==Trivia==
*This emote is based on [[The Umbra]]'s laugh, which was primarily used in [[Totality Tower]].

